## Hints for Future Agents
The cask step deliberately omits --greedy: auto_updates casks (Edge, VS Code, Tailscale, etc.) keep self-updating. Note that discord/notion/obsidian/whatsapp have auto_updates=true yet still appear in plain `brew outdated --cask`, so they DO get upgraded by this step. A post-commit hook autopushes master on commit, so amend before committing, not after.

